id: pm-slack-wvog
title: Scope preflight override to pm-slack's owned commands
description: "registerPreflight used the bare-function (global) form, which collides pairwise with every other installed package's preflight override (pm health reports extension_preflight_override_collision). Rewrite it to the scoped object form declaring exactly the posting command paths the gate covers (slack notify, slack digest). slack test is deliberately excluded (offline preview). The runtime matches a command against the commands array by exact normalized path, so the array lists full command paths, not a bare top-level name (which would never match slack notify and silently disable the webhook validation). The authoritative fail-fast stays in the command handlers; this only narrows the override's scope."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
